                                                "sense_id": "e8f203b0-c2d7-3aa8-981a-21e7a83d6566",
                                                "text": "The traffic signs on motorways are particularly clear and well lit at night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d48cb60-765b-4aee-a4b1-97e9ad1488dc",
                                                "sense_id": "e8f203b0-c2d7-3aa8-981a-21e7a83d6566",
                                                "text": "2021, \"New rules on major EU roads should improve infrastructure safety\", ETSC\nOne omission is any language on getting roads ready for automated systems in transport. ETSC had called for provisions on ensuring that road markings, signs and infrastructure take into account the specific needs of e.g. traffic sign recognition and automated lane keeping systems."
